          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
          "id": 20,
          "options": {
            "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false },
            "content": "| Component | Monthly Cost | Notes |\n|-----------|:-----------:|-------|\n| **EKS Control Plane** | **$73** | Always-on, managed by AWS |\n| **30-min Idle Window** | **$16** | GPU stays warm between requests |\n| **EBS Snapshot (200GB)** | **$10** | Pre-loaded model weights |\n| **CloudFront + WAF + API GW** | **$6** | Edge security + API key auth |\n| **gp3 Throughput Upgrade** | **$4** | 400 MB/s + 6000 IOPS |\n| **TOTAL** | **$109** | Split across key holders by request count |",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "title": "Shared Infra Breakdown",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Dashboard --" },
          "description": "",
          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 10 },
          "id": 21,
          "options": {
            "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false },
            "content": "### Cost Attribution Method\n\n| Cost Type | How It's Allocated |\n|-----------|-------------------|\n| **GPU Compute** (green) | By **GPU time** — each key's IntegrationLatency / total |\n| **Shared Infra** (purple) | By **request count** — each key's requests / total |\n\n**Per-key formula:**\n```\nKey Cost = (key GPU time / total GPU time) x GPU spend\n         + (key requests / total requests) x $109\n```",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "title": "Cost Attribution Method",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
